<P><B>((++LEX)):</B>
`vaṭṭā'ṭal uṇṭaiyuruṭṭal.
<P><B>((++/LEX)):</B>
<P><B>((++AUTHORITY)):</B>
ivai "kaṭṭaḷai yaṉṉa vaṭṭaraṅ kiḻaittuk --
kallāc ciṟāar nellivaṭ ṭāṭum" {{naṟṟiṇai 3}} eṉpataṉā ṉaṟika.

