"pullā veḻuttiṟ poruḷil vaṟuṅkōṭṭi"
{{nālaṭiyār 155}} eṉpuḻip pōla,
collumporuḷum neṟippaṭā veṉpatām.(1)




<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0402"><H3>402</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
