<P>[aḵtāvatu, kāmam, vekuḷi, kaṭumpaṟṟuḷḷam, māṉam, uvakai,
matameṉappaṭṭa kuṟṟaṅkaḷāṟaṉaiyum aracaṉ taṉkaṇikaḻāmaṟ kaṭital.
ivaṟṟai vaṭanūlār pakaivarkkameṉpa. ivai kuṟṟameṉṟaṟitalum
kaṭitalum aṟivuṭaiyārkkallatu kūṭāmaiyiṉ, ataṉpiṉ
vaikkappaṭṭatu.]





<HR>
