cēṭillaiyām
<DT> pōku āṟu akalākkaṭai
<DD>pōkiṉṟa neṟiyaḷavu ataṉiṟ perukātāyiṉ.
</DL>

<P>

`iṭṭi'teṉavum `akalā'teṉavum vanta paṇpiṉṟoḻilkaḷ poruṇmē
ṉiṉṟaṉa. poruḷeṉpatu atikārattāṉ varuvittu, aḷaveṉpatu
piṉṉuṅkūṭṭi yuraikkappaṭṭaṉa. mutalum celavun tammuḷoppiṉuṅ
kēṭillaiyeṉpatām.(8)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0479"><H3>479</H3></A>
