ceyvarāyiṉ?
</DL>

<P>

`karuvi'kaḷāvaṉa: mūvakaiyāṟṟalum nālvakai yupāyaṅkaḷumām; avai
uḷavāyavaḻiyuṅ kālam vēṇṭumeṉpa taṟivittaṟku, `karuviyā' ṉeṉṟār.
ellā viṉaiyum eḷitiṉ muṭiyumeṉpatām.(3)





