kaṇṇuṭaiyarāyiṟ kāṭcikkaṇṇē aḵtōṭumeṉpatu paṟṟik `kaṇṇōṭṭa
millavar kaṇṇila' reṉak kūṟip piṉ ataṉai yetirmaṟaimukattāṉ
viṟakkiṉār.
<P><B>((++GRAM)):</B>
ummai iṟantatu taḻīiya ~eccavummai.

<P><B>((++CODA)):</B>
