nallaṟivuṅ kāriyamuyaṟciyu miṉmaipaṟṟi `mara' meṉṟum,
marattiṟkuḷḷa payaṉpāṭiṉmaipaṟṟi `makkaḷātalē vē' ṟeṉṟuṅ kūṟiṉār.
