<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>maṭi neṭunīr maṟavi tuyil nāṉkum
<DD>maṭiyum viraintuceyvataṉai nīṭṭittucceyyu miyalpum maṟappum
