<DD>nūlōrkaṭinta viṉaikaḷait tāmuṅ kaṭintoḻiyātu poruṇōkkic ceyta
amaiccarkku
<DT> avaitām muṭintālum pīḻai tarum
<DD>avai tūyavaṉmaiyiṉ muṭiyā, oruvāṟṟāṉ muṭiyiṉum piṉṟuṉpattaiyē
koṭukkum.
</DL>

<P>
muṭital karutiya poruṭarutal. pīḻaitarutalākiya poruḷiṉ ṟoḻil
ataṟkukkāraṇamāya viṉaikaṇmē lēṟṟappaṭṭatu.(8)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0659"><H3>659</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>aḻakkoṇṭa vellā maḻappō miḻappiṉum 
