`tuṇivu' kalaṅkāmai. aḵtuṭaiyārkkallatu kaṇikamāya muyaṟcittuṉpa
nōkkātu nilaiyutaluṭaiya pariṇāmaviṉpattai nōkkic ceytal
kūṭāmaiyiṉ `tuṇivāṟṟic ceyka' veṉṟār.

