`amaiyārtō' ḷeṉavē, añcutaṟ kāraṇattatu eṇmai kūṟiyavāṟu.
vīrartōḷkaḷai veṉṟārāyiṉum illāṭōḷkaḷai añcuvār
āṇ#aimilareṉpatām.

<P><B>((++CODA)):</B>
ivai nāṉku pāṭṭāṉum avaḷai yañcutaṟ kuṟṟaṅ
kūṟappaṭṭatu
<P><B>((++/CODA)):</B>

(6)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0907"><H3>907</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>peṇṇēval ceytoḻuku māṇmaiyi {{peṇmai āṇmaikaṭkup poruḷ
<BR>kaṭpulaṉāya amaitit taṉmai; āḷuntaṉmai eṉpar
nacciṉārkkiṉiyar.}}  ṉāṇuṭaip
