poymmaiyaiṭaiya muyakkam
<DT> iruṭṭu aṟaiyil ētil piṇam taḻīiyaṟṟu
<DD>piṇameṭappār iruṭṭaṟaikkaṇṇē muṉṉaṟiyāta piṇattait
taḻuviṉāṟpōlum.
</DL>

