kaḷḷiṉaiyuṇṇāmaiyatu ciṟappu etirmaṟai mukattāṟ kūṟukiṉṟār.]





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0921"><H3>921</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
