<DT> paḻakiya celvamum paṇpum keṭukkum
<DD>akkaḻivu toṉṟutoṭṭu vanta avaṉ celvattiṉaiyum
naṟkuṇaṅkaḷaiyum pōkkum.
</DL>

<P>
`paḻakiya' veṉpatu paṇpuṭaṉumiyaiyum. tāṉ ceytukoḷḷum
aṟamutaliyavēyaṉṟi muṉṉōrait toṭaṅki varukiṉṟa celvamum, muṉceyta
nalviṉaiyiṉ payaṉāya paṇpum ilavāmeṉpatām.(7)




<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0938"><H3>938</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>poruḷkeṭuttup poymēṟ koḷīi yaruḷkeṭut
<BR>talla luḻappikkuñ cūtu.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT> cūtu
<DD>cūtu
