tuṟattal. atuceyyātu koṇṭiruttal iraṇṭaṉaiyu māḷappaṇṇutaliṉ,
ataṉai avaṟṟiṟkuk `kūṟ' ṟeṉṟār. iṉi muṟṟat tuṟattalāvatu
tuppuravillāmaiyiṉ oruvāṟṟāṟ ṟuṟantārāyiṉār. piṉṉavaṟṟai maṉattāṟ
